# Force LF line endings on checkout across all platforms. The repo is authored
# on macOS/Linux (LF), so this only changes what Windows checks out — it keeps
# the generated-docs drift tests (e.g. test/docs-sync.test.ts) byte-identical to
# their LF originals on the Windows CI runner.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git must never touch.
*.png binary

# CHANGELOG.md is appended to by parallel branches (docs/v3-workplan.md §3): every
# branch adds bullets at the end of an [Unreleased] subsection, so two appends to the
# same subsection are both wanted. `union` keeps both sides' lines instead of raising
# a conflict; the order of the kept bullets is checked by hand after the rebase.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
